UID:brisbane-1on3rcl@dothings
DTSTART;TZID=Australia/Brisbane:20260924T183000
DTEND;TZID=Australia/Brisbane:20260924T210000
SUMMARY:Monster Life Drawing
DESCRIPTION:**Tickets will be on sale at midday on Friday the 28th of Augus
 t on this page. Join us for Monster Life Drawing in Netherworld’s Lost S
 ouls Bar! In conjunction with Fortitude Valley SFX queen Megan Farquharson
  Makeup Artist (IG @_mf_fx)\, we’re digging into a night of illustration
 s with a twist. We’ll provide you with the materials for a handful of st
 ill life and life drawing setups\, but in the way you’d expect from the 
 Netherworld. You’ll be presented with fantasy\, horror and sci fi inspir
 ed models in costume and SFX makeup\, alongside creatures and items from t
 he depths of the Netherworld. Each ticket comes with your first drink\, th
 e materials and an evening of illustration guided by a host. This session 
 happens on Thursday the 24th of September at 6.30pm – grab a spot below!
LOCATION:Netherworld\, 186 Brunswick Street
URL:https://www.netherworldarcade.com/event/monster-life-drawing-4/
