BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:brisbane-14fip7a@dothings
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260904
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260928
SUMMARY:Verso Projects. Festival Village\, South Bank
DESCRIPTION:The civic heart of Brisbane Festival. From sunrise to last call
  Verso Projects. Festival Village\, South Bank is the civic heart of Brisb
 ane Festival – a riverside gathering place alive with music\, performanc
 e\, food\, art and nightlife from sunrise to late night. As the city wakes
 \, mornings begin with sunrise rituals\, soundscapes\, movement and daybre
 ak dance parties by the river. Through the day\, the Village hums with fre
 e activities for all ages – giant singalongs\, pop-up performances\, wor
 kshops\, conversations and moments of surprise around every corner. Then\,
  as night falls\, the energy shifts. Bright Nights by ANZ transforms the s
 kyline in an explosion of sound\, water and light\, and the Village switch
 es on after dark with live music\, DJs and late-night revelry. Come for a 
 headline show or stumble into something completely unexpected. Grab a drin
 k\, pull up a seat by the river\, follow the lights\, join the party and s
 tay for one more. The Village is where the city gathers to switch on\, lig
 ht up and come alive together. Brisbane Festival is an initiative of the Q
 ueensland Government and Brisbane City Council. Discover the full 2026 fes
 tival program now via the Brisbane Festival website.
LOCATION:South Bank\, Brisbane City\, South Bank\, corner Ernest Street\, S
 tanley Street and Grey Street\, South Brisbane
URL:https://www.brisbanefestival.com.au/events
END:VEVENT
