SUMMARY:Portrait Painting Workshop - Dave fENOGLIO
DESCRIPTION:#block-yui_3_17_2_1_1787275646529_9720 { --opacity: 100%\; --tr
 anslate-x: 0px\; --translate-y: 0px\; --rotation: 0deg\; --scale-x: 100%\;
