SUMMARY:Old Words\, Finding New Places: First languages in creative practic
 es panel
DESCRIPTION:Join us and hear from Quandamooka artist Elisa Jane Carmichael\
 , Gunditjmara artist Dr Vicki Couzens\, Gurindji/Malngin artist Leah Leama
 n\, Gamilaraay/Wailwan and Biripi artist r e a and led by Pakana Curator D
 r Zoe Rimmer for the first in a series of public conversations highlightin
 g the embodiment\, activation and renewed presence of First Nations langua
 ges.
