BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:brisbane-gf05ws@dothings
DTSTART;TZID=Australia/Brisbane:20261003T110000
DTEND;TZID=Australia/Brisbane:20261003T120000
SUMMARY:Deinzel Morris - Book launch
DESCRIPTION:Join local author Deinzel Morris on the Banyan Lawn as she laun
 ches her new book 'Holy Shigamoley\, WTF Just Happened?' with the Brisbane
  public. What happens when your life falls apart so completely that the on
 ly way forward is through the wreckage? In Holy Shigamoley\, WTF Just Happ
 ened? \, Deinzel Morris opens the door to the wildest\, darkest\, funniest
 \, and most transformational chapter of her life. From closing a teaching 
 business and stepping into a dangerous new world\, to drugs\, love\, heart
 break\, psychosis\, hospital wards\, spiritual signs\, family bonds\, and 
 the long road back to herself\, this memoir is a brutally honest account o
 f what it means to break\, survive\, heal\, and keep laughing through the 
 chaos. Told with raw humour\, deep vulnerability\, and no polished filter\
 , this is not a story about having all the answers. It is a story about lo
 sing your mind\, finding your truth\, and learning that even in the messie
 st parts of life\, love can still pull you home. Messy. Dark. Funny. Hones
 t. Human. This is chaos\, truth\, love\, and transformation - exactly as i
 t happened.
LOCATION:Roma Street Parkland\, Brisbane City\, Roma Street Parkland\, 1 Pa
 rkland Boulevard\, Brisbane City
URL:https://www.trumba.com/calendars/brisbane-city-council?eventid=20667063
 5
END:VEVENT
