BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:brisbane-3lfs08@dothings
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260923
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260929
SUMMARY:ESCAPE
DESCRIPTION:This is a show that will leave you breathless. Visceral and hig
 h-octane\, ESCAPE blends complex\, moving architectural structures with mu
 lti-talented performers to create a blood-pumping and emotional multimedia
  experience. Along with DIAVOLO’s signature athletic movement aesthetic\
 , ESCAPE features a collection of the company’s most famous architectura
 l structures. Each evokes a story unique to its design\, echoing themes of
  exploration\, danger\, fear\, survival\, resilience\, and connection\, al
 l brought to life through a soundtrack spanning decades and genres\, from 
 pop and EDM to rock. DIAVOLO | Architecture in Motion® productions explor
 e innovation and celebrate the complexity of the human condition with an u
 ndefinable blend of dance\, stunt work\, acrobatics\, circus arts\, and pe
 destrian movement. The work is athletic\, captivating\, and visceral. Bris
 bane Festival is an initiative of the Queensland Government and Brisbane C
 ity Council. Discover the full 2026 festival program now via the Brisbane 
 Festival website.
LOCATION:Queensland Performing Arts Centre (QPAC)\, South Brisbane\, Queens
 land Performing Arts Centre\, Cnr Melbourne and Grey Street\, South Brisba
 ne
URL:https://www.brisbanefestival.com.au/events/escape
END:VEVENT
