  surrounded by bushland for an hour of forest bathing yoga. Allow your sen
 ses to absorb the beautiful forests while stretching and strengthening you
 r body mindfully. Suitable for all abilities.
LOCATION:Downfall Creek Bushland Centre\, Downfall Creek Bushland Centre\, 
 815 Rode Road\, Chermside West
