DTSTART;TZID=Australia/Brisbane:20260927T140000
DTEND;TZID=Australia/Brisbane:20260927T150000
SUMMARY:Bands in Parks: Dances\, Dreams & Distant Shores
DESCRIPTION:Bands in Parks performs at Brisbane City Hall. Embark on a musi
 cal journey across continents\, cultures\, and imaginations with Lawchestr
 aQ. From the lively Celtic melodies of Anderson's Irish Suite and the fier
 y energy of Bizet's Farandole and Brahms' beloved Hungarian Dances\, this 
 program celebrates music inspired by place and tradition. The concert is f
 ree but if you would like to sit and sip with a glass of wine and cheese p
 late\, or enjoy afternoon tea and cake\, then it’s just $12 per person. 
 Bookings can be made by calling the Brisbane City Hall Concierge Desk on 0
 457 068 055. Make it an afternoon out – invite family and friends for an
  afternoon at City Hall.
LOCATION:Brisbane City Hall\, Brisbane City\, Brisbane City Hall\, 64 Adela
 ide Street\, Brisbane City
URL:https://www.trumba.com/calendars/LIVE?eventid=205893707
