SUMMARY:Jiaoying Summers (CHN/USA)
DESCRIPTION:Jiaoying Summers is one of comedy's fastest-rising global stars
 \, blending fearless\, dark humor with deeply personal storytelling and a 
 refreshingly international perspective. Born in China and now based in Aus
 tin\, Texas\, Jiaoying transforms cultural clashes\, immigrant identity\, 
 marriage\, and motherhood into razor-sharp comedy that resonates with audi
 ences around the world.With over 2 billion views across social media and a
  fanbase of more than 5 million followers\, Jiaoying has become one of...
LOCATION:The Tivoli\, 52 Costin St
URL:https://thetivoli.com.au/events/jiaoying-summers
END:VEVENT
