DTEND;TZID=Australia/Brisbane:20260929T221500
SUMMARY:City of God
DESCRIPTION:Classic screening. New Farm Cinemas & Regal Graceville: Sat 19 
 September. In the slums of Rio\, two kids' paths diverge as one struggles 
 to become a photographer and the other a kingpin.
