BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:brisbane-1w4852u@dothings
DTSTART;TZID=Australia/Brisbane:20260929T210000
DTEND;TZID=Australia/Brisbane:20260929T230000
SUMMARY:Teenage Sex and Death at Camp Miasma
DESCRIPTION:Festival screening. New Farm Cinemas. Direct from winning the Q
 ueer Palm at Cannes\, Hannah Einbinder and Gillian Anderson electrify in t
 his equally camp and bloody psychosexual thriller from queer maverick Jane
  Schoenbrun (I Saw the TV Glow). After years of slapdash sequels and wanin
 g fandom\, the Camp Miasma slasher franchise is handed over to an enthusia
 stic young director (Einbinder\, Hacks) for resurrection. But when she vis
 its the original movie’s star (Anderson\, The X-Files)\, a now-reclusive
  actress shrouded in mystery\, the two women fall into a blood-soaked worl
 d of desire\, fear\, and delirium.
LOCATION:New Farm Cinemas\, 701 Brunswick St\, New Farm
URL:https://www.fivestarcinemas.com.au/new-farm/movie/teenage-sex-and-death
 -at-camp-miasma
