DTEND;TZID=Australia/Brisbane:20260930T170000
SUMMARY:Brisbane Sculpture Festival 2026
DESCRIPTION:Explore the captivating world of sculpture through Sculptors Qu
 eensland’s dynamic exhibitions\, showcasing the mastery of local artists
 . Our curated displays unveil the diverse expressions of form\, material\,
  and concept\, offering a visual feast for art enthusiasts. Join us on a j
 ourney of discovery and appreciation\, as we celebrate the power of sculpt
 ure to inspire\, provoke thought\, and elevate the human experience. Sculp
 tors Queensland\, Brisbane Sculpture Festival is open during Brisbane Bota
 nic Gardens Mt Coot-tha opening hours.
LOCATION:Brisbane Botanic Gardens Mt Coot-tha\, Brisbane Botanic Gardens Mt
  Coot-tha\, 152 Mt Coot-tha Road\, Toowong
