DTSTART;TZID=Australia/Brisbane:20261001T100000
DTEND;TZID=Australia/Brisbane:20261001T113000
SUMMARY:Junior explorers: Nature journaling for kids (9+ years)
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy a fun workshop learning the basics of nature journaling\,
  the creative practice of recording your interactions with nature on paper
 . You can use sketches\, paintings\, poetry\, species lists\, numbers\, gr
 aphs\, cartoons and more. This fun\, relaxing practice encourages mindfuln
 ess\, hones observation skills\, and builds a sense of curiosity and wonde
 r! BYO sketch/art pad. Other materials provided. This activity is for the 
 general public. If you are a daycare or vacation group interested in atten
 ding a similar activity please send an email . Requirements: Please bring 
 your your own sketch/art pad. Arrive 10 minutes early to check in. All chi
 ldren must be directly supervised throughout by an adult booked into the e
 vent. Hat\, sun-safe clothing\, fully enclosed shoes (no thongs or open sh
 oes please)\, sunscreen\, insect repellent. Please bring an outdoor chair 
 if you would like to use one. Bring water and a snack if required as there
  are no food outlets on site. Note: This activity will go ahead in light r
 ain and will be adapted for delivery indoors if required. Outdoor events a
 re subject to weather and environmental conditions and may be cancelled on
  the day.
LOCATION:Boondall Wetlands Environment Centre\, Boondall Wetlands Environme
 nt Centre\, 31 Paperbark Drive (entry via Stanworth Rd)\, Boondall
URL:https://www.eventbrite.com.au/e/1998469442901?aff=oddtdtcreator
END:VEVENT
