 Join us at Marhaba Café for a Chatty Table—a simple and friendly way to
  meet new people over a cuppa. Pull up a chair and enjoy a chat with other
 s in your community\, whether you’re dropping in for a quick hello or st
 aying a while. Location : Brisbane City Hall (basement level). Enter via t
 he corner of Adelaide and Albert Streets—look for the pink signs and tak
 e the stairs down. Hosted by a friendly volunteer\, the Chatty Table creat
 es a space where conversation flows easily and everyone is welcome.
