SUMMARY:Phone-free Viewing: Make Believe: Magic
DESCRIPTION:Free yourself from digital devices and immerse yourself in the 
 experience of 'Make\,Believe\,Magic: The Worlds of The Jim Henson Company'
 \, without the crowds. Grab a pencil and paper to sketch iconic characters
  in the exhibition\, or simply take a seat\, slow down\, and admire your f
 avourite puppet friends up close. Audiences are encouraged to leave their 
 phones and digital devices at the free cloak room before attending this vi
 ewing. / Free drawing materials available.
LOCATION:GOMA\, Stanley Place\, South Bank
