DESCRIPTION:Two-day hands-on workshop providing demonstrations and making. 
 This workshop will explore and\, hopefully\, demystify the meaning\, aesth
 etics and practical considerations of Chawan\, and give the participants t
 he skills and understanding they need to include Chawan in their own studi
 o practice.
