SUMMARY:Studio Sessions: Chamber Players 3
DESCRIPTION:Chamber Players is a wonderful opportunity to hear and get to k
 now the members of the QSO on a more individual level. Enjoy hand-picked c
 hamber repertoire by a small group of our musicians as they introduce and 
 share personal connections to each piece while you relax into a delightful
  Sunday afternoon concert in the QSO home studio. Location: Queensland Sym
 phony Orchestra Studio\, corner of Grey and Russell Street\, South Brisban
 e. Queensland Symphony Orchestra is proudly supported by Brisbane City Cou
 ncil.
