SUMMARY:Cosmic Collisions
DESCRIPTION:Collisions\, both dazzling and destructive\, release energy tha
 t drives the growth and evolution of the universe and shape our place with
 in it. Produced by the American Museum of Natural History. Narrated by Rob
 ert Redford. Session concludes with a virtual tour of the Brisbane night s
 ky. Cosmic Collisions is suitable for ages 8 and over. For younger childre
 n\, we recommend Perfect Little Planet or Tycho Goes to Mars . Cosmic Coll
 isions was developed by the American Museum of Natural History\, New York 
 in collaboration with the Denver Museum of Nature & Science\; GOTO INC\, T
 okyo\, Japan\; and the Shanghai Science & Technology Museum. Cosmic Collis
 ions was created by the American Museum of Natural History with the major 
 support and partnership of NASA\, Science Mission Directorate\, Heliophysi
 cs Division.
LOCATION:Sir Thomas Brisbane Planetarium\, Mt Coot-tha\, Sir Thomas Brisban
 e Planetarium\, 152 Mt Coot-tha Road\, Mt Coot-tha
URL:https://www.trumba.com/calendars/brisbane-city-council?eventid=20841799
 6
