DESCRIPTION:Lord Mayor's City Hall Concerts presents The Andrews Sisters Tr
 ibute . THIS PERFORMANCE IS AUSLAN INTERPRETED. The Andrews Sisters Tribut
 e is a joyful\, live and melodious celebration of timeless music. Three dy
 namic\, harmony-loving divas and their live swingin' band take audiences o
 n a nostalgic journey through the bright\, unforgettable hits of the 1940s
  to the 1960s\, with a few delightful surprises. If you love classics like
  Boogie Woogie Bugle Boy\, Rum and Coca-Cola and Candyman\, you're in for 
 an absolute treat! This Lord Mayor's City Hall Concert is produced by Evol
 ution Productions.
