 t time ! This immersive and groundbreaking expedition takes you back to th
 e golden age of ancient Egypt\, allowing you to explore the depths of the 
 iconic pyramids\, meet the goddess Bastet\, observe the embalming ceremony
  of Khufu\, and much more! Embark on a journey to the past already experie
 nced by more than 1 million people with the Horizon of Khufu! Highlights 
 📜 The largest immersive expedition of its kind dedicated to ancient Egy
 pt 🧭 Travel back of 4500 years in time to the heart of ancient Egypt 
 🏆 Over 2.5+ million visitors worldwide 😎 Move freely through the Gre
 at Pyramid of Giza in a fully immersive virtual reality experience 🔎 En
 ter forbidden corridors\, uncover the mysteries of the Queen’s Chamber\,
  and meet the goddess Bastet 👨‍👩‍👧‍👧 Enjoy an intimate a
 nd educational experience designed especially for small groups 🌟 Develo
 ped in collaboration with Egyptologist Peter der Manuelian from Harvard Un
 iversity 🎁 Gift memories to someone special! Purchase a gift card here
LOCATION:Fever Immersive Center in Brisbane
URL:https://feverup.com/m/558113
END:VEVENT
