SUMMARY:Clubbercise fitness class
DESCRIPTION:Ready to party your way fit? Clubbercise is a high-energy\, eas
 y-to-follow dance workout set to your favourite club anthems from the 90s 
 to now - think disco lights\, fun vibes\, and serious feel-good energy. Jo
 in us getting our party on with flashing lights\, pumping beats\, and a ro
 om full of legends just like you - ready to move\, glow\, and feel amazing
 . You work at your own level\, we keep it simple\, and together we enjoy t
 he music! Wear your most comfortable clothes (we encourage a bit of fluoro
  flair)\, lace up your trainers\, and bring a towel and water bottle. You
 ’ll leave feeling energised\, empowered\, and totally alive. Because you
  don’t just want to work out… you want to have a blast doing it - righ
 t? Class prices: $30 casual $55 for 2 classes $125 for 5 classes (glowstic
 ks to keep) $240 for 10 classes (glowsticks to keep). Requirements: Wear c
 omfy shoes and clothes (we love a bit of fluoro!). Bring a towel & water b
 ottle. If it's your first class\, please come in 10mins early to fill in a
  health questionnaire. Walk ins are welcome. Cash or Bank Transfer accepte
 d. No dance experience needed - just come to move\, glow\, and feel good. 
 Classes are weekly!
LOCATION:Bracken Ridge Hall\, Bracken Ridge\, Bracken Ridge Hall\, 77 Brack
 en Street\, Bracken Ridge
URL:https://tidycal.com/breekwilliams/clubbercisebrackenridge
