BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:brisbane-10v1ylw@dothings
DTSTART;TZID=Australia/Brisbane:20260930T183000
DTEND;TZID=Australia/Brisbane:20260930T203000
SUMMARY:Verity
DESCRIPTION:Sneak Peek screening. Ladies Night Preview Screenings: Wed 30 S
 eptember. Adapted from Colleen Hoover's best-selling novel\, this seductiv
 e\, psychological thriller follows renowned author Verity Crawford (Anne H
 athaway) and Lowen Ashleigh (Dakota Johnson)\, a struggling writer who rel
 ocates to the remote Crawford estate to ghostwrite for Verity. After Lowen
  uncovers what appears to be Verity's chilling autobiographical notes\, sh
 e wrestles with the disturbing and twisted confessions about Verity’s hu
 sband Jeremy (Josh Hartnett)\, and finds it hard to separate fiction from 
 reality\, manipulation from attraction\, and opportunity from obsession.
LOCATION:The Elizabeth Picture Theatre\, 175 Elizabeth St\, Brisbane City
URL:https://www.fivestarcinemas.com.au/the-elizabeth/movie/verity
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:brisbane-1f8z4es@dothings
DTSTART;TZID=Australia/Brisbane:20260930T184500
DTEND;TZID=Australia/Brisbane:20260930T204500
SUMMARY:LINKIN PARK: UNSHATTER
DESCRIPTION:Premiere screening. New Farm Cinemas and Tower Cinemas Newcastl
 e. The hardest part of ending is starting again. After a seven-year hiatus
  following the devastating loss of their beloved bandmate Chester Benningt
 on\, LINKIN PARK’S remaining members struggle to find their way forward.
  Their shared history and enduring friendship\, combined with the fresh pe
 rspective of two new band members spark a renewed creative energy that lea
 ds them on a transformative journey of artistic reinvention. Following the
  band from intimate 2022 studio sessions through their explosive FROM ZERO
  album release and concert in São Paulo\, the film UNSHATTER weaves toget
 her rare vault footage\, electrifying performances from sold-out shows\, a
 nd candid interviews with band members and fans—capturing the raw\, hone
 st story of what it means to start over.
LOCATION:New Farm Cinemas\, 701 Brunswick St\, New Farm
URL:https://www.fivestarcinemas.com.au/new-farm/movie/linkin-park-unshatter
END:VEVENT
